/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">小鼠胸腺淋巴瘤细胞<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t<\/tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">CT26<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">小鼠结肠癌细胞<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t<\/tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">LLC<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">小鼠肺癌细胞<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t<\/tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">4T1<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">小鼠乳腺癌细胞<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t<\/tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">BMSCs<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">大鼠骨髓间充质干细胞永生化<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t<\/tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">CHO<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">中国仓鼠卵巢细胞<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t<\/tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">HD11<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">鸡巨噬细胞<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t<\/tr>\r\n\t<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>\r\n<p>\r\n\t数据由厦门逸漠生物提供\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">多能通用：兼容多种RNA包括siRNA、mRNA、miRNA等的高效转染。<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">极简操作：操作简便，快速配制，可使用完全培养基，无需换液处理。<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#E53333;\">数据验证<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<img src=\"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20260121\/20260121140853_93671.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"168\" =\"\"=\"\" align=\"\">\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#E53333;\">注意事项<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">1．转染复合物配制需按顺序进行，吹打速度要快，避免聚集；<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">2．转染前细胞的状态会影响转染效率，状态良好及对数生长期的细胞容易转染；<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">3．转染前细胞汇合度需控制在70%-80%，过高或过低均影响效率；<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">4．如需使用其他剂量，推荐等比例调节x、y、z体积比列；<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">5．本产品应密封4℃储存，避免反复冻融；<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">6．本产品兼容血清、双抗、不换液等条件转染；<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">7．本产品用于mRNA、siRNA转染，mRNA使用浓度：0.5 mg\/mL，siRNA使用浓度：20μM；同时支持miRNA、ASO、sgRNA转染，根据分子量换算成对应20μM siRNA浓度即可。<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#E53333;\">转染流程<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">1．接种细胞至70%–80%汇合度时转染；<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">2．Reagent A和Reagent B恢复至室温，涡旋；<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">3．EP管中加入x μL ReagentA&nbsp;，y μL的RNA溶液，吹打混匀；<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">4．加入z μL ReagentB，快速吹打混匀20次，室温孵育5min；<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">5．加入m μL的完全培养基，轻轻吹打混匀5次制备转染复合液；<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">6．取转染复合液n μL滴加入细胞孔中，摇动培养板，轻轻混匀；<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">7．24 ~72 h检测分析。<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">表1. RNA转染用量推荐<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<table border=\"1\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<br \/>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">ReagentA（x）<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">RNA（y）<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">ReagentB（z）<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">完全培养基（m）<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">转染复合液（n）<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">培养体系<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t<\/tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">6孔板<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">12<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">4<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">4<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">180<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">200<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">2000 μL<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t<\/tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">12孔板<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">6<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\